    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422770/extras/63706d08f6c981e3dae5d840142a1a68.webp?t=1735712627\" /></span><br><br><strong>The Stars Are Hungry is a horror adventure game</strong>. The flagship station ceased communications two months ago, and you alone are being sent to find out why.<br><br>Upon arrival, you're greeted with empty rooms and faulty power. Something has very clearly gone wrong, you'll have to track down someone who can answer for this. Assuming anyone's still alive, that is.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the twisting corridors of the Bilai, discovering rooms that shouldn't be possible.<br></li><li>Uncover the secrets of astronauts past, and find what remains of them.<br></li><li>Fight through crowds of body horror creatures in hand-drawn dynamic 6 color pixel art<br></li><li>Solve the station's mysteries through multiple endings, some more hidden than others. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422770/extras/63706d08f6c981e3dae5d840142a1a68.webp?t=1735712627\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422770/extras/63706d08f6c981e3dae5d840142a1a68.webp?t=1735712627\" /></span><br><br><strong>The Stars Are Hungry is a horror adventure game</strong>. The flagship station ceased communications two months ago, and you alone are being sent to find out why.<br><br>Upon arrival, you're greeted with empty rooms and faulty power. Something has very clearly gone wrong, you'll have to track down someone who can answer for this. Assuming anyone's still alive, that is.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the twisting corridors of the Bilai, discovering rooms that shouldn't be possible.<br></li><li>Uncover the secrets of astronauts past, and find what remains of them.<br></li><li>Fight through crowds of body horror creatures in hand-drawn dynamic 6 color pixel art<br></li><li>Solve the station's mysteries through multiple endings, some more hidden than others. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422770/extras/63706d08f6c981e3dae5d840142a1a68.webp?t=1735712627\" /></span>",
